  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Give menstrual health and childbirth resources</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our goal is to train 3,000 women and girls to make reusable menstrual pads and to supply Mama kits to 100 pregnant women in the greater Jinja area of southeastern Uganda.  Sanitary products are unaffordable for many young women and girls, forcing them to miss classes or drop out of school at puberty. Similarly, pregnant women must supply their own childbirth essentials (called Mama kits) to receive hospital care during labor and delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
